AnimaSeek 15 — unofficial iOS 15 backport

Modified 2026-11-21 by the AnimaSeek iOS 15 contributors.
Corresponding source: https://github.com/tranquil222/AnimaSeek-iOS15
Based on AnimaSeek: https://github.com/alexandreteles/AnimaSeek
Originally derived from Seeker for Android: https://github.com/jackBonadies/SeekerAndroid

This is a modified version, not an official upstream AnimaSeek release. It adds
iOS 15 compatibility, older-system background-transfer fallbacks, opaque file
and folder menus, solid navigation/tab bars, and TrollStore build packaging.
The original copyright, license, and attribution notices remain in the source.
The application is distributed under GPLv3; see the repository's LICENSE.

This is a modified version of Soulseek.NET.  It is not maintained by,
endorsed by, or affiliated with the Soulseek.NET project or its author(s).

The bundled protocol library is the upstream AnimaSeek Protocol Component,
based on Soulseek.NET 10.0.2. Its GPLv3 license and Additional Terms are in
Seeker/Soulseek.NET-master/LICENSE in the source and LICENSE beside the app
executable and in the IPA root. Its original NOTICE is bundled in the app.
The backport uses a separate client minor identifier, 20261501, instead of
upstream AnimaSeek's 793. Public source searches on 2026-11-21 found no known
Soulseek client using 20261501; this is not a claim of a registry reservation.

Other dependencies retain their own licenses; see THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES and
licenses/. The About and Legal Notices screens preserve the attribution and
modified-library notice and link to this fork's source.
